    "content": "Chip stocks experienced a massive downturn, losing $2 trillion in just eight trading sessions as yields topped 5%. This sharp decline has raised concerns and tested investor faith in the ongoing artificial intelligence boom. Financial analysts and market experts remain divided on whether this drop presents a buying opportunity for investors looking to capitalize on the AI sector's long-term potential.",
